---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="闪跃深度测评与使用指南 - 2026 最新评测" 
  description="闪跃 (Flash) 就像它的名字一样，以雷霆万钧的速度征服用户。底层依托强大的企业级带宽资源，全节点部署最新拥塞控制算法，即使在最拥堵的晚高峰也能逆风翻盘。"
>
  <div class="review-page-shell">
    <div class="rp-header">
      <img src="/images/brands/shanyue.png" alt="闪跃" class="rp-logo" onerror="this.src='data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI0OCIgaGVpZ2h0PSI0OCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2U0ZTlmMiIvPjwvc3ZnPg=='" />
      <div class="rp-title-wrap">
        <h1>闪跃机场深度测评</h1>
        <p class="rp-subtitle">2026年最新测速与解锁报告</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rp-content">
      <div class="bcp-text-intro">
        <h2>闪跃简介</h2>
        <p>闪跃 (Flash) 就像它的名字一样，以雷霆万钧的速度征服用户。底层依托强大的企业级带宽资源，全节点部署最新拥塞控制算法，即使在最拥堵的晚高峰也能逆风翻盘。</p>
        
        <h2>节点覆盖</h2>
        <p>全球核心骨干网直连，香港、台湾、日本、美国四大核心区带宽冗余极高。闪跃不做花里胡哨的百国节点，只把最常用的线路打磨到极致的快与稳。</p>
        
        <h2>流媒体与AI解锁</h2>
        <p>完美应对 Netflix 封杀与 OpenAI IP 限制，落地端每日自动检测并更新原生 IP 库，确保用户在任何时候打开海外应用都能无缝畅享。</p>
        
        <h2>价格套餐</h2>
        <p>价格透明，拒绝套路。提供按量付费与周期包月双模式，流量单价极具竞争力。全自动化运维，购买后一秒下发订阅，支持支付宝等国内便捷支付。</p>
      </div>

            <div class="rp-action" style="margin-top: 50px; text-align: center;">
        <div class="rp-promo" style="display: inline-block; background: #fffbeb; border: 1px solid #fde68a; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px; color: #b45309; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600;">
          🎁 本站专属优惠码：<code style="background: #fef3c7; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; color: #ea580c; font-size: 1.2rem; margin-left: 4px; user-select: all;">cs0ekCMG</code>
        </div>
        <br>
        <a href="https://wep01.flashleapaff.com/#/?code=cs0ekCMG" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener noreferrer" class="rp-btn-official" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #2563eb); color: #fff; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 18px 48px; border-radius: 50px; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(59,130,246,0.3); transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; max-width: 90%; margin: 0 auto;">
          前往 闪跃 官网注册安全通道 
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"></line></svg>
        </a>
        <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
          <a href="/" class="rp-btn-back" style="color: #64748b; font-size: 1.05rem; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding-bottom: 2px; transition: color 0.2s;">
            ← 返回机场推荐列表
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <style is:inline>
    .review-page-shell {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 60px 20px 100px;
    }
    .rp-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      padding-bottom: 30px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .rp-logo {
      width: 90px;
      height: 90px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
      object-fit: cover;
    }
    .rp-title-wrap h1 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      font-weight: 800;
    }
    .rp-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: #64748b;
      margin: 0;
    }
    
    .bcp-text-intro {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      padding: 40px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
    }
    .bcp-text-intro h2 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .bcp-text-intro h2::before {
      content: "";
      display: inline-block;
      width: 6px;
      height: 22px;
      background: #3b82f6;
      border-radius: 3px;
    }
    .bcp-text-intro p {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: #334155;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }
    .bcp-text-intro h2:not(:first-child) {
      margin-top: 40px;
    }
    .bcp-text-intro p:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    
    .rp-action {
      margin-top: 50px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .rp-btn-back {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #ffffff;
      color: #3b82f6;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 2px solid #3b82f6;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .rp-btn-back:hover {
      background: #3b82f6;
      color: #fff;
    }
    
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .rp-header {
        flex-direction: column;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .bcp-text-intro {
        padding: 24px;
      }
      .bcp-text-intro h2 {
        font-size: 1.3rem;
      }
      .bcp-text-intro p {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
      }
    }
      .rp-btn-official:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 15px 25px rgba(59,130,246,0.4) !important;
    }
    .rp-btn-back:hover {
      color: #3b82f6 !important;
      border-color: #3b82f6 !important;
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
